  "duration_s": 292.407007,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "好好好，谁学一声狗叫，我就给谁一千块钱。今天有个业务要和供应商那边对接，我有别的事情要忙，你俩就替我去一趟吧。好的，王姐保证完成任务哦。哦，对了，供应商那边的陈姐可是个厉害角色，别被人家拿捏喽。师傅能不能快点啊，我们有急事儿，哎呀，慢点安全不差。这一会儿师傅麻烦快点，我早上吃坏了东西，感觉要憋不住了。哎呦，小姑娘，你忍住哈，马上就到了，马上到人家这儿拜访也不能空着手吧，走咱们看看去买点礼物。好的，我觉得也是听说这个陈姐爱打羽毛球，那这个球拍正合适，一千多块够档次。那我买盒羽毛球吧，也是一千多，陈姐肯定喜欢我这个高档球拍，羽毛球买这么贵的，干啥不都一个样吗？哟感谢两位百忙中，来我们这儿，欢迎欢迎陈姐，您真客气，这我听说您爱打羽毛球，特意给您挑了个好球拍，破费了。陈姐，这是我给您买的羽毛球，听说是手工制作的，我也不懂，您凑合用吧。还有这球手感可棒了。小姑娘这么远过来，饿了吧，走走走包间，我都订好了，咱们边吃边聊。感谢陈姐和大家的宴请。这俗话说的好，酒杯一拿，事业发达，酒杯一台，升官发财，酒杯，一举鹏程万里。酒杯一碰黄金乱蹦，酒杯一响，黄金万两，酒杯一干业绩翻番。来，我们一起举杯啊。陈姐，我敬你一杯，你凭什么敬我这一杯？陈姐，我们不图升官，也不图财，究竟您愿意看得起我们这些晚辈，很多东西花钱都买不到，但您几句话就能把我们点透，真的得记一辈子。哈哈。好好好，这话我爱听干。今天这桌菜合不合你胃口啊，饭菜是填饱肚子的。您讲的话才是充实脑子的。今天这顿饭不重要，能坐在这儿，听您说话才是真的赚大了啊。哈哈哈哈听听都听听这姑娘会说话，棒棒棒棒。好，谁学一声狗叫，我就给谁一千块钱。对，祝陈姐家庭旺，事业旺，以后日子旺，上家旺，一共四生四千块，哈哈哈哈哈哈哈。好，这酒开了，怎么不先给我倒，先到的是客，后到的是主。您是今天的主人，最后一杯满上代表压肘，全桌的福气都沉淀在您这杯里。说的好，这杯我干了让你跑这么远，送我耽误你俩工作了吧，不耽误在办公室忙一天是把事儿做完，路上听您聊半个小时，是学怎么把事儿做好，这哪是耽误啊，这是赚了。哈哈哈哈。今天咱们两家公司谈的很开心，下批材料我给你们价格再低十点，让你多赚点儿，太感谢了。陈姐您慢走，琳琳，你太厉害了，今天这陈姐可太难对付了，没你我肯定完蛋。你这嘴皮子是咋练的呀？我总是嘴笨，反应慢，一点儿，不会说。我父母从小就让我看这本把话说的恰到好处。假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交推荐你读完这本把话说的恰到好处，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，你每天就看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。在这本书里有一句话，我特别欣赏，他，写的是面对别人夸你优秀，你可以回，那是不优秀点儿，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当别人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者，趁和你在一起啊，熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下吴若兵，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？当我看到这段的时候，这个真是让我欲解心开啊。每一句都很有意思，就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下，应该怎么说。书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心的拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，还有配套书籍，把事做的恰到好处，但凡学会三分，你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。这套书真的可以帮助到你好的林姐，我这就回去看。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 770,
      "text": "好好好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1430,
      "end_ms": 2530,
      "text": "谁学一声狗叫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2730,
      "end_ms": 4135,
      "text": "我就给谁一千块钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7120,
      "end_ms": 9440,
      "text": "今天有个业务要和供应商那边对接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9980,
      "end_ms": 11160,
      "text": "我有别的事情要忙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11200,
      "end_ms": 12600,
      "text": "你俩就替我去一趟吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00007",
      "start_ms": 12940,
      "end_ms": 13260,
      "text": "好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13260,
      "end_ms": 15040,
      "text": "王姐保证完成任务哦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00009",
      "start_ms": 15400,
      "end_ms": 15640,
      "text": "哦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00010",
      "start_ms": 15660,
      "end_ms": 16060,
      "text": "对了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00011",
      "start_ms": 16680,
      "end_ms": 19160,
      "text": "供应商那边的陈姐可是个厉害角色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00012",
      "start_ms": 19360,
      "end_ms": 20685,
      "text": "别被人家拿捏喽。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00013",
      "start_ms": 24760,
      "end_ms": 26140,
      "text": "师傅能不能快点啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00014",
      "start_ms": 26140,
      "end_ms": 27020,
      "text": "我们有急事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00015",
      "start_ms": 27020,
      "end_ms": 27360,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00016",
      "start_ms": 27380,
      "end_ms": 28720,
      "text": "慢点安全不差。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00017",
      "start_ms": 28720,
      "end_ms": 33370,
      "text": "这一会儿师傅麻烦快点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00018",
      "start_ms": 33410,
      "end_ms": 34790,
      "text": "我早上吃坏了东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00019",
      "start_ms": 35570,
      "end_ms": 36870,
      "text": "感觉要憋不住了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00020",
      "start_ms": 37290,
      "end_ms": 37710,
      "text": "哎呦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00021",
      "start_ms": 38210,
      "end_ms": 38730,
      "text": "小姑娘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00022",
      "start_ms": 38730,
      "end_ms": 39430,
      "text": "你忍住哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00023",
      "start_ms": 39690,
      "end_ms": 40510,
      "text": "马上就到了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00024",
      "start_ms": 40530,
      "end_ms": 46900,
      "text": "马上到人家这儿拜访也不能空着手吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00025",
      "start_ms": 46920,
      "end_ms": 48220,
      "text": "走咱们看看去买点礼物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00026",
      "start_ms": 48480,
      "end_ms": 48940,
      "text": "好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00027",
      "start_ms": 49020,
      "end_ms": 51860,
      "text": "我觉得也是听说这个陈姐爱打羽毛球，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00028",
      "start_ms": 52260,
      "end_ms": 53580,
      "text": "那这个球拍正合适，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00029",
      "start_ms": 53960,
      "end_ms": 55260,
      "text": "一千多块够档次。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00030",
      "start_ms": 56700,
      "end_ms": 58060,
      "text": "那我买盒羽毛球吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00031",
      "start_ms": 58140,
      "end_ms": 58900,
      "text": "也是一千多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00032",
      "start_ms": 59680,
      "end_ms": 62105,
      "text": "陈姐肯定喜欢我这个高档球拍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00033",
      "start_ms": 62510,
      "end_ms": 63510,
      "text": "羽毛球买这么贵的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00034",
      "start_ms": 63510,
      "end_ms": 64890,
      "text": "干啥不都一个样吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00035",
      "start_ms": 64910,
      "end_ms": 66950,
      "text": "哟感谢两位百忙中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00036",
      "start_ms": 66950,
      "end_ms": 67610,
      "text": "来我们这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00037",
      "start_ms": 67610,
      "end_ms": 69390,
      "text": "欢迎欢迎陈姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00038",
      "start_ms": 69530,
      "end_ms": 70365,
      "text": "您真客气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00039",
      "start_ms": 70660,
      "end_ms": 72495,
      "text": "这我听说您爱打羽毛球，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00040",
      "start_ms": 72800,
      "end_ms": 74185,
      "text": "特意给您挑了个好球拍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00041",
      "start_ms": 75080,
      "end_ms": 75845,
      "text": "破费了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00042",
      "start_ms": 76170,
      "end_ms": 76565,
      "text": "陈姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00043",
      "start_ms": 76940,
      "end_ms": 78360,
      "text": "这是我给您买的羽毛球，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00044",
      "start_ms": 78720,
      "end_ms": 80040,
      "text": "听说是手工制作的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00045",
      "start_ms": 80040,
      "end_ms": 80560,
      "text": "我也不懂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00046",
      "start_ms": 80560,
      "end_ms": 81465,
      "text": "您凑合用吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00047",
      "start_ms": 82020,
      "end_ms": 84575,
      "text": "还有这球手感可棒了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00048",
      "start_ms": 85000,
      "end_ms": 86180,
      "text": "小姑娘这么远过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00049",
      "start_ms": 86180,
      "end_ms": 86785,
      "text": "饿了吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00050",
      "start_ms": 87090,
      "end_ms": 87830,
      "text": "走走走包间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00051",
      "start_ms": 87830,
      "end_ms": 88510,
      "text": "我都订好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00052",
      "start_ms": 88530,
      "end_ms": 89535,
      "text": "咱们边吃边聊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00053",
      "start_ms": 91150,
      "end_ms": 92945,
      "text": "感谢陈姐和大家的宴请。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00054",
      "start_ms": 93600,
      "end_ms": 94685,
      "text": "这俗话说的好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00055",
      "start_ms": 95150,
      "end_ms": 95870,
      "text": "酒杯一拿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00056",
      "start_ms": 95910,
      "end_ms": 96630,
      "text": "事业发达，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00057",
      "start_ms": 96830,
      "end_ms": 97650,
      "text": "酒杯一台，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00058",
      "start_ms": 97750,
      "end_ms": 98590,
      "text": "升官发财，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00059",
      "start_ms": 98890,
      "end_ms": 99250,
      "text": "酒杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00060",
      "start_ms": 99250,
      "end_ms": 100635,
      "text": "一举鹏程万里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00061",
      "start_ms": 100990,
      "end_ms": 102510,
      "text": "酒杯一碰黄金乱蹦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00062",
      "start_ms": 102670,
      "end_ms": 103370,
      "text": "酒杯一响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00063",
      "start_ms": 103370,
      "end_ms": 104170,
      "text": "黄金万两，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00064",
      "start_ms": 104330,
      "end_ms": 105830,
      "text": "酒杯一干业绩翻番。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00065",
      "start_ms": 106090,
      "end_ms": 106330,
      "text": "来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00066",
      "start_ms": 106390,
      "end_ms": 107785,
      "text": "我们一起举杯啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00067",
      "start_ms": 110430,
      "end_ms": 110945,
      "text": "陈姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00068",
      "start_ms": 111410,
      "end_ms": 112205,
      "text": "我敬你一杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00069",
      "start_ms": 112910,
      "end_ms": 114205,
      "text": "你凭什么敬我这一杯？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00070",
      "start_ms": 117160,
      "end_ms": 117755,
      "text": "陈姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00071",
      "start_ms": 118530,
      "end_ms": 119430,
      "text": "我们不图升官，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00072",
      "start_ms": 119450,
      "end_ms": 120275,
      "text": "也不图财，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00073",
      "start_ms": 120810,
      "end_ms": 122770,
      "text": "究竟您愿意看得起我们这些晚辈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00074",
      "start_ms": 123090,
      "end_ms": 124965,
      "text": "很多东西花钱都买不到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00075",
      "start_ms": 125390,
      "end_ms": 127485,
      "text": "但您几句话就能把我们点透，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00076",
      "start_ms": 128070,
      "end_ms": 129365,
      "text": "真的得记一辈子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00077",
      "start_ms": 129830,
      "end_ms": 130265,
      "text": "哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00078",
      "start_ms": 130790,
      "end_ms": 131880,
      "text": "好好好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00079",
      "start_ms": 132060,
      "end_ms": 133635,
      "text": "这话我爱听干。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00080",
      "start_ms": 138530,
      "end_ms": 140345,
      "text": "今天这桌菜合不合你胃口啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00081",
      "start_ms": 141760,
      "end_ms": 143315,
      "text": "饭菜是填饱肚子的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00082",
      "start_ms": 143860,
      "end_ms": 145915,
      "text": "您讲的话才是充实脑子的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00083",
      "start_ms": 146180,
      "end_ms": 147595,
      "text": "今天这顿饭不重要，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00084",
      "start_ms": 147960,
      "end_ms": 148600,
      "text": "能坐在这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00085",
      "start_ms": 148600,
      "end_ms": 151115,
      "text": "听您说话才是真的赚大了啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00086",
      "start_ms": 151330,
      "end_ms": 155705,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈听听都听听这姑娘会说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00087",
      "start_ms": 156150,
      "end_ms": 157030,
      "text": "棒棒棒棒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00088",
      "start_ms": 157030,
      "end_ms": 157205,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00089",
      "start_ms": 158480,
      "end_ms": 159620,
      "text": "谁学一声狗叫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00090",
      "start_ms": 159800,
      "end_ms": 161165,
      "text": "我就给谁一千块钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00091",
      "start_ms": 163910,
      "end_ms": 164150,
      "text": "对，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00092",
      "start_ms": 164550,
      "end_ms": 166050,
      "text": "祝陈姐家庭旺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00093",
      "start_ms": 166070,
      "end_ms": 166630,
      "text": "事业旺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00094",
      "start_ms": 166730,
      "end_ms": 167690,
      "text": "以后日子旺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00095",
      "start_ms": 167690,
      "end_ms": 168290,
      "text": "上家旺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00096",
      "start_ms": 168350,
      "end_ms": 169795,
      "text": "一共四生四千块，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00097",
      "start_ms": 170530,
      "end_ms": 171515,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00098",
      "start_ms": 172210,
      "end_ms": 172435,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00099",
      "start_ms": 179080,
      "end_ms": 179720,
      "text": "这酒开了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00100",
      "start_ms": 179720,
      "end_ms": 180695,
      "text": "怎么不先给我倒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00101",
      "start_ms": 182210,
      "end_ms": 183050,
      "text": "先到的是客，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00102",
      "start_ms": 183170,
      "end_ms": 184055,
      "text": "后到的是主。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00103",
      "start_ms": 184380,
      "end_ms": 185380,
      "text": "您是今天的主人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00104",
      "start_ms": 185460,
      "end_ms": 186860,
      "text": "最后一杯满上代表压肘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00105",
      "start_ms": 186920,
      "end_ms": 189120,
      "text": "全桌的福气都沉淀在您这杯里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00106",
      "start_ms": 189720,
      "end_ms": 190260,
      "text": "说的好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00107",
      "start_ms": 190340,
      "end_ms": 192000,
      "text": "这杯我干了让你跑这么远，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00108",
      "start_ms": 192000,
      "end_ms": 194200,
      "text": "送我耽误你俩工作了吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00109",
      "start_ms": 194460,
      "end_ms": 197975,
      "text": "不耽误在办公室忙一天是把事儿做完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00110",
      "start_ms": 198290,
      "end_ms": 199615,
      "text": "路上听您聊半个小时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00111",
      "start_ms": 199920,
      "end_ms": 201040,
      "text": "是学怎么把事儿做好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00112",
      "start_ms": 201440,
      "end_ms": 202360,
      "text": "这哪是耽误啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00113",
      "start_ms": 202360,
      "end_ms": 203065,
      "text": "这是赚了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00114",
      "start_ms": 203490,
      "end_ms": 204135,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00115",
      "start_ms": 204780,
      "end_ms": 206775,
      "text": "今天咱们两家公司谈的很开心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00116",
      "start_ms": 207120,
      "end_ms": 209400,
      "text": "下批材料我给你们价格再低十点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00117",
      "start_ms": 209540,
      "end_ms": 210365,
      "text": "让你多赚点儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00118",
      "start_ms": 210640,
      "end_ms": 211160,
      "text": "太感谢了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00119",
      "start_ms": 211160,
      "end_ms": 212165,
      "text": "陈姐您慢走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00120",
      "start_ms": 215290,
      "end_ms": 215650,
      "text": "琳琳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00121",
      "start_ms": 215790,
      "end_ms": 216790,
      "text": "你太厉害了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00122",
      "start_ms": 216790,
      "end_ms": 218330,
      "text": "今天这陈姐可太难对付了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00123",
      "start_ms": 218390,
      "end_ms": 219485,
      "text": "没你我肯定完蛋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00124",
      "start_ms": 219940,
      "end_ms": 221500,
      "text": "你这嘴皮子是咋练的呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00125",
      "start_ms": 221680,
      "end_ms": 222560,
      "text": "我总是嘴笨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00126",
      "start_ms": 222620,
      "end_ms": 223160,
      "text": "反应慢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00127",
      "start_ms": 223220,
      "end_ms": 223540,
      "text": "一点儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00128",
      "start_ms": 223540,
      "end_ms": 224095,
      "text": "不会说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00129",
      "start_ms": 224770,
      "end_ms": 228165,
      "text": "我父母从小就让我看这本把话说的恰到好处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00130",
      "start_ms": 228460,
      "end_ms": 229520,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00131",
      "start_ms": 229580,
      "end_ms": 230280,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00132",
      "start_ms": 230300,
      "end_ms": 231120,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00133",
      "start_ms": 231240,
      "end_ms": 235065,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交推荐你读完这本把话说的恰到好处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00134",
      "start_ms": 235390,
      "end_ms": 237375,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00135",
      "start_ms": 237820,
      "end_ms": 239035,
      "text": "你每天就看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00136",
      "start_ms": 239340,
      "end_ms": 240620,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00137",
      "start_ms": 240860,
      "end_ms": 243280,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00138",
      "start_ms": 243340,
      "end_ms": 244460,
      "text": "在这本书里有一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00139",
      "start_ms": 244460,
      "end_ms": 245295,
      "text": "我特别欣赏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00140",
      "start_ms": 245550,
      "end_ms": 245690,
      "text": "他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00141",
      "start_ms": 245690,
      "end_ms": 247390,
      "text": "写的是面对别人夸你优秀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00142",
      "start_ms": 247430,
      "end_ms": 248115,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00143",
      "start_ms": 248400,
      "end_ms": 249415,
      "text": "那是不优秀点儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00144",
      "start_ms": 249590,
      "end_ms": 250795,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00145",
      "start_ms": 251140,
      "end_ms": 252400,
      "text": "当别人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00146",
      "start_ms": 252460,
      "end_ms": 253880,
      "text": "你就回近朱者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00147",
      "start_ms": 253880,
      "end_ms": 255200,
      "text": "趁和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00148",
      "start_ms": 255220,
      "end_ms": 257780,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00149",
      "start_ms": 257780,
      "end_ms": 258960,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00150",
      "start_ms": 259120,
      "end_ms": 260375,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00151",
      "start_ms": 260610,
      "end_ms": 261830,
      "text": "强将手下吴若兵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00152",
      "start_ms": 261970,
      "end_ms": 263255,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00153",
      "start_ms": 263620,
      "end_ms": 264860,
      "text": "当我看到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00154",
      "start_ms": 264860,
      "end_ms": 266685,
      "text": "这个真是让我欲解心开啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00155",
      "start_ms": 267010,
      "end_ms": 268290,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00156",
      "start_ms": 268350,
      "end_ms": 270970,
      "text": "就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00157",
      "start_ms": 270970,
      "end_ms": 271775,
      "text": "应该怎么说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00158",
      "start_ms": 272200,
      "end_ms": 275080,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00159",
      "start_ms": 275080,
      "end_ms": 276440,
      "text": "你就放心的拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00160",
      "start_ms": 276700,
      "end_ms": 278100,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00161",
      "start_ms": 278240,
      "end_ms": 280300,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00162",
      "start_ms": 280420,
      "end_ms": 281500,
      "text": "还有配套书籍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00163",
      "start_ms": 281720,
      "end_ms": 283115,
      "text": "把事做的恰到好处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00164",
      "start_ms": 283620,
      "end_ms": 284760,
      "text": "但凡学会三分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00165",
      "start_ms": 284980,
      "end_ms": 287235,
      "text": "你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00166",
      "start_ms": 287910,
      "end_ms": 291035,
      "text": "这套书真的可以帮助到你好的林姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_546665fe45b7f450_s00167",
      "start_ms": 291330,
      "end_ms": 292205,
      "text": "我这就回去看。"
    }
  ],
